Package: aidatabroker
Type: Package
Title: Read Open Data on the AI Training Data Market
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yuma", "Heymans", email = "hello@aidata.broker", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads the open datasets published by 'AIData.Broker' on the
    market for AI training data: public prices, licensing deals, buyers,
    vendors, lawsuits and related tables, each row with its source, from
    <https://aidata.broker/datasets>. The data are licensed CC BY 4.0.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://aidata.broker/datasets
